Mango Anland 5 integration (locally adapted combined patch)

Upstream baseline: 3b119a23b785db47d0f2b2aa2ed36787ad5ae167
Original Anland changes: luochen88, 91acc518688a4db979d05771d34dffec2be6d744
Local integration: private sysconfdir, opt-in session management,
external backend build/header wiring, and compositor-provided text input.
README and backend C/header payloads are intentionally omitted.
Backend files are supplied by producers/mango/anland_backend/.
This is not the original author's unmodified commit patch.

